      "id": 1,
      "text": "Plentywood earned its name when Dutch Henry joked, “If you go two miles up this creek, you’ll find plenty wood,” after searching for firewood.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
